[{"location":"95-reference/#reference","page":"Reference","title":"Reference","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"95-reference/#Contents","page":"Reference","title":"Contents","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"95-reference/","page":"Reference","title":"Reference","text":"Pages = [\"95-reference.md\"]","category":"page"},{"location":"95-reference/#Index","page":"Reference","title":"Index","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"95-reference/","page":"Reference","title":"Reference","text":"Pages = [\"95-reference.md\"]","category":"page"},{"location":"95-reference/","page":"Reference","title":"Reference","text":"Modules = [NCL]","category":"page"},{"location":"95-reference/#NCL.NCLModel","page":"Reference","title":"NCL.NCLModel","text":"NCLModel(nlp)\n\nSubtype of AbstractNLPModel designed to represent an NCL subproblem. A general problem of the form\n\nminimize   f(x)\nover       x\nsubject to lvar ≤ x ≤ uvar\n           lcon ≤ c(x) ≤ ucon\n\nis transformed into\n\nminimize   f(x) + λ'r + ρ ‖r‖²\nover       x, r\nsubject to lvar ≤ x ≤ uvar\n           lcon ≤ c(x) + r ≤ ucon\n\nwhere λ is a vector of Lagrange multiplier estimates and ρ > 0 is a penalty parameter.\n\nInput arguments\n\nnlp::AbstractNLPModel  the original problem\n\nKeyword arguments\n\nresid::Float64  the initial residual value (default 0)\nresid_linear::Bool  whether or not residuals are added to linear constraints\nρ::Float64  initial penalty parameter\ny::AbstractVector{Float64}  initial Lagrange multiplier estimates\n\nReturn value\n\nncl::NCLModel  the transformed model.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"95-reference/#NCL._check_available_solver-Tuple{Symbol}","page":"Reference","title":"NCL._check_available_solver","text":"_check_available_solver(solver::Symbol)\n\nReturn an error if solver is not in NCL.available_solvers\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"","page":"NCL","title":"NCL","text":"CurrentModule = NCL","category":"page"},{"location":"#NCL","page":"NCL","title":"NCL","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"","page":"NCL","title":"NCL","text":"Documentation for NCL.","category":"page"},{"location":"tutorial/#NCL.jl-Tutorial","page":"NCL.jl Tutorial","title":"NCL.jl Tutorial","text":"","category":"section"}]
